{"title":"ROM after dark, Halloween","startsAt":"2026-10-31T19:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T23:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"The Royal Ontario Museum in Toronto periodically has “ROM after dark” parties, with live music. Attendees are welcome to walk through the exhibits or dancing to their hearts content. beer, wine and mixed drinks available for purchase.\n\nOn Saturday October 31st, they have a Halloween themed event, running from 7:30 PM to 11:30 PM.\n\nTickets are $40.00 plus tax.\n\nGuests attending the event may opt to wear/not wear costumes as they see fit.\n\nIs there interest in attending this event ?\n\n(If yes, individuals would be responsible for purchasing their own individual tickets).","venue":{"name":"Royal Ontario Museum","address":"Bloor street, Toronto","lat":43.66758,"lng":-79.39466,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Peterborough Outdoor Activity","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/8/7/a/highres_501330842.jpeg"}